<view class="page {{role}} "><view wx:if="{{denied}}" class="denied">{{denied}}<button class="primary" bindtap="home">返回首页</button></view><block wx:else><view class="activity-cover {{a.color}}" style="height:330rpx;border-radius:22rpx"><view class="cover-kicker">GOOD FORTUNE AWAITS</view><view class="cover-name" style="font-size:49rpx;width:75%">{{a.name}}</view><view class="cover-art">幸</view><text class="cover-badge">{{a.playType}}</text></view><view class="card" style="margin-top:25rpx"><view class="row"><text class="card-title" style="margin:0">{{a.name}}</text><text class="status">{{labels[a.status]}}</text></view><view class="merchant-name" style="margin-top:25rpx" bindtap="openShop">⌂ {{a.merchant}} ›</view><view class="divider"></view><view class="body-text">{{a.description}}</view><view class="metric-grid"><view class="metric"><text>{{remaining}}</text><text class="metric-label">剩余名额 / 注</text></view><view class="metric"><text>{{probability}}%</text><text class="metric-label">中奖概率</text></view><view class="metric"><text>{{a.betCount}}</text><text class="metric-label">中奖权益 / 注</text></view></view></view><marketing-game type="{{a.playType}}" bind:play="participate"/><view class="card"><view class="card-title">参与规则</view><view class="body-text">1. 每人限参与 {{a.perUserLimit}} 次，未中奖也计次数。<view class="line-break"></view>2. 中奖人数上限 {{a.maxWinnerCount}} 人，概率不保证发满。<view class="line-break"></view>3. 名额以提交时的最新库存为准。<view class="line-break"></view>4. 领奖前需登录并完成手机号及微信绑定。<view class="line-break"></view>5. 出票结果以服务状态为准，模拟数据不代表真实彩票。</view></view><button class="primary" bindtap="participate" disabled="{{a.status!=='RUNNING'}}">{{a.status==='RUNNING'?'参与活动，遇见幸运':'活动暂不可参与'}}</button></block></view>